el.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Low\",\"Medium\",\"High\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Alert Security Personnel: Personnel ID, Security Level' links the 'Alert Security Personnel' activity with the attributes 'Personnel ID' and 'Security Level'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Handle Customer Complaint\",\"description\":\"The 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity includes addressing and resolving complaints raised by customers.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Customer ID\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Customer ID: integer between 1 and 10000' represents the unique identification number assigned to each customer.\",\"min_value\":1,\"max_value\":10000,\"enumeration_values\":null},{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Complaint Status\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Complaint Status: Resolved, Unresolved' indicates whether a customer complaint has been resolved or remains open.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Resolved\",\"Unresolved\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Handle Customer Complaint: Customer ID, Complaint Status' links the 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity with the attributes 'Customer ID' and 'Complaint Status'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Perform Security Audit\",\"description\":\"The 'Perform Security Audit' activity involves conducting a comprehensive evaluation of the store's security measures.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Audit Score\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Audit Score: float between 0.0 and 100.0' represents the numerical score resulting from a security audit evaluation.\",\"min_value\":0.0,\"max_value\":100.0,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Perform Security Audit: Audit Score' links the 'Perform Security Audit' activity with the attribute 'Audit Score'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Bag Check\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Bag Check' activity involves inspecting customers' bags for prohibited items or suspicious content.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Customer ID\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Customer ID: integer between 1 and 10000' represents the unique identification number assigned to each customer.\",\"min_value\":1,\"max_value\":10000,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Conduct Bag Check: Customer ID' specifies that the activity 'Conduct Bag Check' requires the attribute 'Customer ID'.\"}],\"constraints\":[{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Store Entrance' must be the first activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"Init\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Store Entrance\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Store Entrance' activity involves overseeing and observing the entry points of the store to ensure security.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Deactivate Alarm' must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Deactivate Alarm\",\"description\":\"The 'Deactivate Alarm' activity involves turning off an alarm system after it has been triggered and verified.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Incident' activity must occur at least once in the process.\",\"template\":\"Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Report Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Incident' activity includes documenting and reporting any security incidents that occur in the store.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":1},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Emergency Drill' must not occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"Absence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Emergency Drill\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Emergency Drill' activity includes performing practice exercises for emergency situations.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":1},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Inspect Security Cameras' activity occurs, then a 'Review Security Footage' activity must eventually occur after the 'Inspect Security Cameras' event at some point in the same process instance, and the 'Camera ID' attribute of the 'Inspect Security Cameras' activity must be equal to the 'Camera ID' attribute of the 'Review Security Footage' activity. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Inspect Security Cameras' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Review Security Footage' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Inspect Security Cameras'. If 'Inspect Security Cameras' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Review Security Footage'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Inspect Security Cameras\",\"description\":\"The 'Inspect Security Cameras' activity includes checking and examining the security camera systems for proper functioning.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Review Security Footage\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Security Footage' activity involves analyzing recorded video from security cameras to identify incidents.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":\"A.Camera ID == T.Camera ID\",\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever a 'Alert Security Personnel' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Escort Suspect' activity in the next event position, with no other events in between. This immediate succession applies only when the 'Security Level' attribute of the 'Alert Security Personnel' activity is 'High'. Additionally, the 'Personnel ID' attribute of the 'Alert Security Personnel' activity must be equal to the 'Personnel ID' attribute of the 'Escort Suspect' activity. The 'Escort Suspect' activity is allowed to happen isolated. This constraint must be triggered between 0 and 5 minutes.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Alert Security Personnel\",\"description\":\"The 'Alert Security Personnel' activity includes notifying security staff about potential security threats or incidents.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Escort Suspect\",\"description\":\"The 'Escort Suspect' activity involves accompanying a suspected individual out of the premises or to a secure area.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Security Level is High\",\"correlation_condition\":\"A.Personnel ID == T.Personnel ID\",\"time_condition\":\"0,5,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Alert Security Personnel' activity can occur only if it is immediately preceded by 'Verify Alarm Trigger' activity, with no other activities occurring in between. This immediate precedence applies only when the 'Alarm Status' attribute of the 'Verify Alarm Trigger' activity is 'Triggered'. This constraint must be triggered between 0 and 10 minutes.\",\"template\":\"Chain Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Alert Security Personnel\",\"description\":\"The 'Alert Security Personnel' activity includes notifying security staff about potential security threats or incidents.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Verify Alarm Trigger\",\"description\":\"The 'Verify Alarm Trigger' activity includes confirming whether an alarm activation is genuine or a false alarm.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Alarm Status is Triggered\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,10,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Perform Security Audit' activity occurs, then 'Update Security Protocols' must also occur in the same process instance, and vice-versa. This mutual obligation applies only when the 'Audit Score' attribute of the 'Perform Security Audit' activity is less than 50.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Perform Security Audit\",\"description\":\"The 'Perform Security Audit' activity involves conducting a comprehensive evaluation of the store's security measures.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Update Security Protocols\",\"description\":\"The 'Update Security Protocols' activity includes revising and improving security procedures based on audit findings.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Audit Score < 50\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Conduct Bag Check' activity must be followed by a 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Handle Customer Complaint' event can occur only if a 'Conduct Bag Check' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. Additionally, the 'Customer ID' attribute of the 'Conduct Bag Check' activity must be equal to the 'Customer ID' attribute of the 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Conduct Bag Check' impose obligations for future 'Handle Customer Complaint', and 'Handle Customer Complaint' cannot occur without prior 'Conduct Bag Check'. Multiple 'Conduct Bag Check' and 'Handle Customer Complaint' are allowed, with each 'Conduct Bag Check' eventually leading to a 'Handle Customer Complaint' and each 'Handle Customer Complaint' being justified by a preceding 'Conduct Bag Check'. This constraint must be triggered between 0 and 1 hour.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Bag Check\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Bag Check' activity involves inspecting customers' bags for prohibited items or suspicious content.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Handle Customer Complaint\",\"description\":\"The 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity includes addressing and resolving complaints raised by customers.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":\"A.Customer ID == T.Customer ID\",\"time_condition\":\"0,1,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Check Inventory Discrepancies' activity cannot be immediately followed by a 'Report Incident' activity; there must be at least one other event between them. Similarly, a 'Report Incident' event cannot be immediately preceded by a 'Check Inventory Discrepancies' event. This constraint allows multiple occurrences of 'Check Inventory Discrepancies' and 'Report Incident' in any order, provided they are not adjacent in the event sequence.\",\"template\":\"Not Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Check Inventory Discrepancies\",\"description\":\"The 'Check Inventory Discrepancies' activity involves investigating differences between recorded and actual inventory levels.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Report Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Incident' activity includes documenting and reporting any security incidents that occur in the store.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Exactly one of the activities 'Train Security Staff' or 'Conduct Emergency Drill' must occur in the process instance. This means that the process is compliant if only 'Train Security Staff' event occurs without any occurrence of 'Conduct Emergency Drill' event, or only 'Conduct Emergency Drill' occurs without any occurrence of 'Train Security Staff'. The process is non-compliant if both 'Train Security Staff' and 'Conduct Emergency Drill' occur, or if neither occurs. The constraint enforces a mutual exclusivity and a mandatory occurrence of one of the specified activities.\",\"template\":\"Exclusive Choice\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Train Security Staff\",\"description\":\"The 'Train Security Staff' activity involves providing training sessions to security personnel on procedures and protocols.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Emergency Drill\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Emergency Drill' activity includes performing practice exercises for emergency situations.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Incident' activity is permitted to occur only if a 'Escort Suspect' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance, and the 'Incident Type' attribute of the 'Report Incident' activity must be 'Theft'. Multiple 'Escort Suspect' can occur, and any number of events (including other 'Report Incident') can happen between a 'Escort Suspect' and a subsequent 'Report Incident'. This ensures that certain actions cannot proceed without the necessary prerequisites being met first.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Report Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Incident' activity includes documenting and reporting any security incidents that occur in the store.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Escort Suspect\",\"description\":\"The 'Escort Suspect' activity involves accompanying a suspected individual out of the premises or to a secure area.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Incident Type is Theft\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Verify Alarm Trigger' activity cannot be preceded by a 'Deactivate Alarm' within the same process instance. If a 'Deactivate Alarm' event has occurred at any point before a 'Verify Alarm Trigger' event, then 'Verify Alarm Trigger' is disallowed. Multiple instances of 'Verify Alarm Trigger' and 'Deactivate Alarm' can occur, but all instances of 'Verify Alarm Trigger' must occur before any instance of 'Deactivate Alarm'.\",\"template\":\"Not Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Verify Alarm Trigger\",\"description\":\"The 'Verify Alarm Trigger' activity includes confirming whether an alarm activation is genuine or a false alarm.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Deactivate Alarm\",\"description\":\"The 'Deactivate Alarm' activity involves turning off an alarm system after it has been triggered and verified.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity occurs in a process instance, then a 'Conduct Bag Check' activity must not occur anywhere in the same process instance. This applies only when the 'Complaint Status' attribute of the 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity is 'Resolved'. Additionally, the 'Customer ID' attribute of the 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity must be equal to the 'Customer ID' attribute of the 'Conduct Bag Check' activity. This means that the occurrence of 'Handle Customer Complaint' event prohibits any occurrence of 'Conduct Bag Check' event. However, if 'Handle Customer Complaint' does not occur, 'Conduct Bag Check' may occur freely. Multiple occurrences of 'Handle Customer Complaint' are allowed, provided 'Conduct Bag Check' does not occur at all in the process instance.\",\"template\":\"Not Responded Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Handle Customer Complaint\",\"description\":\"The 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity includes addressing and resolving complaints raised by customers.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Bag Check\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Bag Check' activity involves inspecting customers' bags for prohibited items or suspicious content.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Complaint Status is Resolved\",\"correlation_condition\":\"A.Customer ID == T.Customer ID\",\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Security Footage' activity and 'Inspect Security Cameras' activity must not occur such that the 'Review Security Footage' event is followed by the 'Inspect Security Cameras' event at any point later in the same process instance. Similarly, an 'Inspect Security Cameras' event must not be preceded by a 'Review Security Footage' event. This means that once a 'Review Security Footage' occurs, 'Inspect Security Cameras' cannot occur afterward, and if 'Inspect Security Cameras' event occurs, it cannot have been preceded by a 'Review Security Footage' event. Both events can occur in the same process instance, but not in the prohibited sequence.\",\"template\":\"Not Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Review Security Footage\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Security Footage' activity involves analyzing recorded video from security cameras to identify incidents.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Inspect Security Cameras\",\"description\":\"The 'Inspect Security Cameras' activity includes checking and examining the security camera systems for proper functioning.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null}]}"